B.a4o=new A.bB("Win (checked at the end of a round, from round 4): Military \u2014 your capital + 2 other Key Regions; Economic \u2014 5 trade routes for 1 rounds in a row; Tech \u2014 research Level 5; same-round ties: more Key Regions, then more Prestige; exact ties share the win. After round 8: most Prestige wins (tie: income).\nPrestige: +1 a round per National Objective held (\u2691); Theater Review +3/+2/+1; \u22121 for a turn without pressure on a rival; standoffs.\nCrisis (Protest \u2192 Threat \u2192 Mobilize \u2192 Strike): when a rival attacks your region, Partner, Objective or home theater, reaches research Level 4+ or plays Corner the Market, you may Protest. The actor makes a Threat (commits a card) or blinks (the action is called off, \u22121/+1); you Mobilize (commit) or blink (\u22122/+2); at the Strike each may add a card and both reveal. Each card counts its number (1-3, top-left corner); Countermeasures makes their highest card count 0. Higher total +6/\u22126; a challenger win cancels the action; a tie lets it go ahead.",null,null,null,null,null,null)
